pon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," of any type that deal damage can be Fire-Linked to increase their output, using up more space than a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cannon, Double/Quad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cannon,_Double/Quad","referenceId":"reference:3e282e7f16004fdd"}," but costing less. (Fire-Linked Turbolasers are often described as \"Batteries,\" but this is not the same thing as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Battery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Battery"}," in game terms.) With every attack, Fire-Linked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missiles and Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missiles_and_Torpedoes"}," consume a number of shots of ammunition equal to the number of Fire-Linked Weapons. A Fire-Linked Weapon has the given availability or the availability of its base ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_System"},", whichever is more restrictive.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Optional Fire-Link:"]}," Some Fire-Linked Weapons, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missiles and Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missiles_and_Torpedoes"},", are designed to have their Fire-Link deactivated to conserve ammunition. The Fire-Link can be turned on or off as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", and the extra damage and ammunition consumption applies only while the Fire-Link is activated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Autofire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Fire-Linked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Cannons"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Ion Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Ion_Cannons"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Turbolasers"}," can fire normally or in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," mode, with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," required to switch between the two.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
